      },
      "text": "By virtue of and pursuant to the au­\nthority vested in me by section 10 of the \nPay Readjustment Act of June 16, 1942 \n(56 Stat. 359, 363), Executive Order 9984 \nof July 31, 1948, prescribing regulations \ngoverning the furnishing of clothing in \nkind or payment of cash allowances in \nlieu thereof to enlisted personnel of the \nNavy, Coast Guard, Naval Reserve, and \nCoast Guard Reserve, is hereby amended \nas follows:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1446,
      "char_start": 1369,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10023#1",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "1.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10023#1",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "13 FR 8173, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d0a0be9e510383ab3d70dcdccf5490b03ee71105352ac7ca69763d04d279e5d9",
        "signing_date": "1948-12-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10023.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9ccdd03fe8a5b0a2f3ef2915a5b9266b2fe6ddcfd24e83dd14d629262955b26a",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-12-22/pdf/FR-1948-12-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "1. The following new subsection 11 is \nadded to Section A at the end thereof:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1900,
      "char_start": 1447,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10023#11",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "11.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10023#11",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "13 FR 8173, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d0a0be9e510383ab3d70dcdccf5490b03ee71105352ac7ca69763d04d279e5d9",
        "signing_date": "1948-12-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10023.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9ccdd03fe8a5b0a2f3ef2915a5b9266b2fe6ddcfd24e83dd14d629262955b26a",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1948-12-22/pdf/FR-1948-12-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "11. In addition to the allowances \nherein prescribed, enlisted men, including \nthose holding chief petty officer rating, \nwho, upon the effective date of this order, \nare serving with or who are subsequently \nassigned to duty as members of the \nunited States Navy Band, shall receive \na cash allowance not to exceed $80.00 for \nthe purchase pf the full dress uniform \nprescribed for members of the United \nStates Navy Band by the Secretary of the \nNavy."
    },
